        "Abstract": "We introduce SQuAD 2.0, a new version of the Stanford Question Answering Dataset. SQuAD 2.0 combines answerable questions from SQuAD 1.1 with 53,775 unanswerable questions written by crowdworkers. To do well on SQuAD 2.0, systems must not only answer questions when possible but also determine when no answer is supported by the paragraph and abstain from answering."
